================================================================================
BUNDLED EXTENDED QUEST LOG ARTWORK
================================================================================

The parchment textures under media/Textures/classic-wow/questLog/ originate from Extended
QuestLog 3.6.1.

Copyright (c) 2006 Daniel Rehn

The supplied EQL3 package did not include a separate license text. These files
retain their original copyright and are not represented as original unrealUI
artwork by the MIT license above. See media/Textures/classic-wow/questLog/ATTRIBUTION.md.


================================================================================
BUNDLED FLAT CLASS-ICON ARTWORK
================================================================================

The flat-*.tga class-icon sheets under media/Textures/class-icons/ come from the
third-party FLATPLAYERICONS pack (a UI-Classes-Circles replacement). The pack
names no author and includes no license text. These files retain their original
ownership and are not represented as original pandaUI artwork by the MIT
license above. See media/Textures/class-icons/ATTRIBUTION.md.


